## 🚀 Quickstart

Ensure you have [Astral `uv`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and [`just`](https://github.com/casey/just) installed.

```bash
# Install recommended AI agent skills
just setup-skills

# Launch the game
just run

# Run headless tests (zero graphics dependencies in test run)
just test

# Check code formatting and linting
just check
```

