## 🎮 Architecture

This game utilizes a **Decoupled 2D Architecture** adhering to `skills/python-raylib`:
- `src/{{ package_name }}/core/`: State definition with `__slots__` and constants.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/game/`: Headless simulation step and scene management.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/engine/`: Raylib hardware interfacing (drawing with `import pyray as pr`, input polling).

AI agents working in this repository should refer to [`AGENTS.md`](file:///home/romuald/Projects/Perso/Skills/AGENTS.md) for architectural guidelines and rules.
